{"title": "Shattered Psyche (Full-illithid) (Condition)", "pageid": 36535, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shattered_Psyche_(Full-illithid)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Psyche_(Condition)\" title=\"Shattered Psyche (Condition)\">Shattered Psyche (Condition)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Fractured_Psyche_(Full-illithid)_(Condition)\" title=\"Fractured Psyche (Full-illithid) (Condition)\">Fractured Psyche (Full-illithid) (Condition)</a>      </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shattered Psyche Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Shattered Psyche</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> is reduced by 6, you have a -5 penalty to all <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> saving throws. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/BringIntoCombat\" title=\"Status properties/BringIntoCombat\">BringIntoCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/InitiateCombat\" title=\"Status properties/InitiateCombat\">InitiateCombat</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the more powerful <a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">Full-illithid</a> version of the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Psyche_(Condition)\" title=\"Shattered Psyche (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shattered Psyche\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Shattered_Psyche_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Psyche_(Condition)\" title=\"Shattered Psyche (Condition)\">Shattered Psyche</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Shattered_Psyche\">Sources of Shattered Psyche</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shatter_Psyche_(Full-illithid)\" title=\"Shatter Psyche (Full-illithid)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp/30px-Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp/45px-Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp/60px-Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shatter Psyche (Full-illithid)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp/30px-Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Shatter_Psyche_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shatter_Psyche_(Full-illithid)\" title=\"Shatter Psyche (Full-illithid)\">Shatter Psyche (Full-illithid)</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203224\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1838/1000000\nPost‐exp